data: {"id": "ebb5979b6a324a2e-thinking-parallel_evidence-751", "run_id": "ebb5979b6a324a2e", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已获取核心 Kubernetes 证据。\n\n### 核心事实（真实工具结果）\n1. **Pod 状态**：`Pending`，被调度到 `node2`。等待原因：`ContainerCreating` (PromQL & Describe 确认)。\n2. **Events (直接原因)**：\n   - `Warning FailedMount` (4m16s前, x40次): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory`\n   - `Warning FailedMount` (24m前, x20次): `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition`\n3. **Pod Spec (yaml)**", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789130870527, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

