data: {"id": "ebb5979b6a324a2e-final", "run_id": "ebb5979b6a324a2e", "seq": 756, "ts_ms": 1789130884383, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v06/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod aiops-case-v06/workload 中定义的 HostPath 卷 'input' 指向宿主机路径 '/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input' 不存在或类型不符（非目录），导致 kubelet 挂载失败，容器无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod phase: `Pending`, status: `Pending` (fact-6fe15cb643d3) | 确定 Pod 处于调度后但未运行的停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `FailedMount`: hostPath type check failed: `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` is not a directory (fact-de260a16da5c) | 直接指明挂载失败的原因为宿主机路径检查不通过 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod condition: `ContainersReady=False` (ContainersNotReady), `Ready=False` (ContainersNotReady) (fact-3ae226773f63, fact-c4693a3b3572) | 确认容器因资源准备不足未就绪，与事件原因吻合 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"}` = 1 (fact-b988d5c23321) | 验证容器卡在创建等待期，未进入运行态 |\n\nK8s Event 直接记录了具体的挂载错误信息，而 Metric 确认了该错误导致的持续等待状态，两者共同锁定了问题范围。由于 Pod 未启动，无日志或 Tracing 数据。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n宿主机路径 '/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input' 不存在或类型不符 (非目录) → kubelet 挂载 HostPath 卷失败 (FailedMount) → 容器保持 ContainerCreating 状态 → Pod 状态为 Pending 且不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 中定义的 `HostPath` 卷 `input` 指向宿主机路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` 不存在或类型不符（非目录），导致 kubelet 挂载失败。\n\n证据编号 [1] 和 [3] 显示 Pod 卡在挂载阶段，证据编号 [2] 明确指出错误原因为 `hostPath type check failed`，且证据编号 [4] 证实容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态。现有 K8s 事实已充分支撑此结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 58.7s\n├─ 问题定位: 22.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 28.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v06/workload: 28.1s (Evidence 22.6s, RCA 5.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v06/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 58.644, "metrics": {"run_id": "ebb5979b6a324a2e", "mttr": {"value": "58.7s", "seconds": 58.65139937400818, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.95, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.75, "weighted_score": 0.15}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 58651.39937400818, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 56135.53166389465, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 5, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 5485.8434200286865, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2165.3878688812256}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22201.69711112976, "success": true}, "parallel_eviden